{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dcc668b684c0380e949e831404cd67ddbfba5811922784f825cbb7f0e583e2c0", "ja": "（今日はイースターを題材にしたPV撮影だけど、\n機材トラブルで、開始が少し押してしまっている）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄复活节题材的PV，\n但因为器材发生状况，开拍时间稍微延后了一些。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "c8770277ff16e45cabc5beeea44984cb1940c45ff96348dd9e5268d2b08f150d", "ja": "お疲れさま、{$P$}。\nこの様子だと、まだちょっと時間かかりそうだね……。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n看目前的状况，似乎还会花上一段时间呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cc53bcc7507568f463f9183b54499dfdbd1605cc9c8f3b7fe23fced94262eff7", "ja": "そうだな……悪いな、のり子。\n準備万端だったろうに、待たせちゃって。", "zh": "是啊……真抱歉，法子，\n你都准备好了，还让你等这么久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "dba0e78720b1193c17af5e791bbfcd36de350a2e9edded16cc6ee2bcc4906429", "ja": "ううん、アタシは平気。全然待てるよ！\n機材トラブルじゃ、しょうがないもんね。", "zh": "不会，我等一下没关系的！\n毕竟器材出状况也没办法嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "b9de55842dba094d117404fd7a68d50d6c888f47ea5ebdf09409a788b22b61d1", "ja": "だから、待つのは平気なんだけど……どうしよう？\nなんかちょっと、緊張してきちゃったよ～！", "zh": "所以等一下没关系，但……怎么办？\n总觉得开始紧张起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1005_p", "source_sha256": "145274c5512d7a4cc85f88074fcc6c2c70bf002d5e242a270fe096e05d84f6c4", "ja": "（待ち時間が長いせいか、不安になってきたのかな。\n何か気分を変えられるような話題は……）", "zh": "（似乎是因等待时间拉长，她开始感到不安了。\n要找点话题让她转换心情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "50ec53434c6a4f1ec83c5c389366eca1572db115a3892efd9102569e644acd84", "ja": "そうだ。のり子は『イースター』って行事の事、\nどのぐらい知ってるんだ？", "zh": "对了，法子，\n你对『Easter（复活节）』这个节日了解多少？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "c0b8472094fdfd509de3d32725e26704fba9170e92d06cb351c4725817e5ba6d", "ja": "え？　あ、うーん……。じ、実はアタシ、\nあんまりよく知らないんだよね……あははっ。", "zh": "咦？啊，这个嘛……\n其实我不是很了解耶……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "7acda831d54cf65b3a6d4d8ebd81e1191436390ca52bf6d756f59858f2e77e01", "ja": "クリスマスみたいな感じ、ってのは聞いたけど……\n{$P$}は詳しいの？", "zh": "只听过好像是类似圣诞节的感觉……\n{$P$}很了解吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9c11922585eb1b7ce1b1df7759b35900bc796f0c25501ef0470e8e0ced82b363", "ja": "俺もすごく詳しい訳じゃないけど、\nイエス・キリストの復活を祝う行事なんだそうだ。", "zh": "我也不算是非常了解，\n但这似乎是庆祝耶稣基督复活的节日。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c4cd417cbcb1490d054680180f9079481b7dee5d52e7dd5a779a77f9c1a34f27", "ja": "海外だとポピュラーな行事で、\n日本語だと『復活祭』って言われてるな。", "zh": "在国外是相当知名的节日，\n用日文来说就是『复活祭』吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "da9e798ac96eb6b8499484bd2a87f66190ca5b0a05c78f3cfa533c5d4e74f92c", "ja": "ん？　復活祭……復活……。\nなるほどっ！　それって、いいかも……！", "zh": "嗯？复活祭……复活……\n原来如此！这似乎不错……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2808e9e55c8292c2cb8d9afad39388b064496b7689b78c441771ebb395c5d49a", "ja": "どうしたんだ、ブツブツ言って。", "zh": "你怎么自言自语起来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "5a53a30afc6a720f4fb5306a5527670e402aa24f1264f75c064c5db70c469ac9", "ja": "いやー、なんかさ。\n復活って言葉って、熱いよね！って思って。", "zh": "没有啦～\n只是觉得复活这个词很热血！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "ea06ef08baf1897bb98efb88180a12ac588dd51ac78c3ffdcba59fc249b299f1", "ja": "だって復活だよ？　もう一度立ち上がるんだよ？\n何度倒れても立ち上がる姿って、しびれるよね？", "zh": "毕竟是复活耶！会重新站起来！\n无论倒下几次都会奋力重振，这很振奋人心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c0fffc18b5feb5c94a49cd6e2a59f4eae90d51c89e3ab70e2649ea21d47fde46", "ja": "そ、そういう復活の仕方じゃない気もするけど……\n確かに、力強さを感じる言葉だな。", "zh": "总、总觉得好像不是那种复活……\n但这个名词之中的确能感受到强韧的力量呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "80afd39401735e1a0681298c25910708f2e9713dbcd251c64992fcdc28a6e9fa", "ja": "でしょ！？　ダウンしてカウント取られて、\nもうダメかも……って思うけど、また立ち上がって！", "zh": "对吧！？当选手被打倒，裁判开始读秒时，\n一度以为已经不行了……没想到却又重新振作起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "f3970d811734872575a2168784265846cc76b73f751d7b05939321f613416af8", "ja": "そうやって頑張る姿に、\nこっちまで涙が出てくるんだよね……！", "zh": "看到这么努力的模样，\n我的眼泪都要飙出来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3c1d149b99b448488e1a89a6b73a01bf260fc787ad6f0f8109f9423e91ddb7a7", "ja": "なるほど……つまり、\n思いっきり応援したくなる、って事だな。", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，\n这会让人想全心替那个选手加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "21b5279d353d6de311d017a335f0a2dbf6cc03658b318396488b82a10f731f71", "ja": "そう！　もう、サイコーに燃える展開だよね！\nだから復活って、熱いなって思ったんだ。", "zh": "没错！实在是热血到不行的发展呢！\n所以我才觉得复活很热血。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1020_p", "source_sha256": "295eea265c482b02461c62ea3a284f705833a3d4ba8364e16c7b19399fe692ea", "ja": "そう考えると、復活っていうのは\nロマンの固まりなのかもしれないな。", "zh": "从这个角度去想，\n复活说不定是个浪漫的概念呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "6adfc7d31ccb1efde12548e58b5cda4e3f882ba12069e5abab7faeb77beb69a3", "ja": "そっか～。なんかアタシにもわかってきた\n気がするよ。イースターの魅力！", "zh": "是喔～\n我好像也开始了解复活节的魅力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "3643fdc435bb66e5b8b9d6821eec5de79e5d408c47cd5628576a95336b966cd6", "ja": "話してたら、エンジン温まってきたかも！\n撮影、早く始まらないかな～？　えへへっ♪", "zh": "聊了一下，感觉也引擎热起来了！\n能不能早点开始拍摄呢～？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7b61dfe694ce7b51802202ec41c74aab5d9979f8e9b1158a1244390d04e4d5d7", "ja": "（ちょっと解釈が独自とはいえ、いい感じに\nのり子のテンションを上げる事ができたみたいだ）", "zh": "（虽然这种解读方式有些特殊，\n但似乎顺利让法子的情绪高昂起来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0114_1024_p", "source_sha256": "86f65e1c62cc8aa4818a2675937064a8d471b119b602c2268cb69ba71f3665d3", "ja": "（その後、無事に器材も復活！　PVはのり子らしさに\n溢れた、パワフルだけど可愛い姿が撮れた）", "zh": "（之后器材也安然复活！PV充分表现出法子的特色，\n捕捉到她活力十足又可爱的模样。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
